<Vertical id="VerticalBranchingDemo" title="Adaptive Content">
  <Markdown id="branching_intro">
## Adaptive Content with `when=`

Answer the question. Additional content appears based on your answer.
  </Markdown>

  <CapaProblem id="branch_problem" title="Concept Check">
    What is the capital of France?
    <KeyGrader id="branch_grader">
      <ChoiceInput id="branch_input">
        <Key>Paris</Key>
        <Distractor>London</Distractor>
        <Distractor>Berlin</Distractor>
        <Distractor>Madrid</Distractor>
      </ChoiceInput>
    </KeyGrader>
  </CapaProblem>

  <CapaProblem id="practice_problem" title="Extra Practice" when="@branch_problem.correct === correctness.incorrect">
    Let's try a related question. What country is Paris in?
    <KeyGrader id="practice_grader">
      <ChoiceInput id="practice_input">
        <Key>France</Key>
        <Distractor>Germany</Distractor>
        <Distractor>Spain</Distractor>
      </ChoiceInput>
    </KeyGrader>
  </CapaProblem>

  <Markdown id="followup_block" when="@branch_problem.correct === correctness.correct">
**Bonus:** Paris has been the capital since the late 10th century under Hugh Capet.
The Seine runs through the city, dividing it into the Left Bank and Right Bank.
  </Markdown>
</Vertical>
